#3200
The Gate of Ash~
   The basalt road comes up out of the flooded valley into a court of
black stone, and the gate here is a wall of ash-coloured masonry with
a single arch burnt through it.  Nothing grows in the court, and the
ash lies in drifts against the wall like snow.  The Spire rises north,
its crown lost in cloud.~
