#3201
The Ash Court~
   A great square of black basalt lies open to a sky the colour of old
iron, and ash falls on it steadily and never accumulates:  something
beneath the flagstones consumes it.  Galleries run along three sides,
and stairs rise to the Spire's first hall on the north.~
