#3202
The Hall of Cinders~
   The hall's floor is a lake of living embers held behind a kerb of
iron, and the heat here is a standing thing.  Suits of blackened mail
stand in ranks along the walls, still in them, as if the wearers had
simply stopped.  A stair climbs north to the galleries.~
