The Gallery of Iron Saints~
   The gallery runs around the inside of the hall's vault, and its
rail is hung with lamps that burn without oil.  Statues of saints of
the old rite stand here in cast iron, each with its face hammered
flat.  Ash lies along the rail in a fine grey line.~
