#3206
The Chamber of Ash and Glass~
   Everything in this chamber is either ash or glass:  the furniture
has been fused, the floor has been glazed to a black mirror, and the
air shimmers.  A coat of arms has been melted into the wall above the
hearth and can no longer be read.~
