#3207
The Foundry of the Spire~
   The foundry fills the whole width of the tower here, and a channel
of white iron runs down its centre from a crucible the size of a
room.  Moulds stand in rows on either side, and the men who work them
do not look up.  The heat is not survivable for long.~
