#3208
The Warden's Vestibule~
   The vestibule is a small square room lined with spear racks and
shield pegs, all of them full.  A brazier burns in the middle of the
floor, and the walls have been whitewashed at some point in the last
year, which is more than can be said for anything else in the Spire.~
