#3209
The Vitarium~
   The vitarium is a glass-roofed hall of green things, and it is the
only warm room in the Spire that smells of growing rather than of
burning.  Beds of herbs and salvage-crops run in rows under the drip
of a hundred small fountains.  The gardener keeps the rows weeded.~
