#3211
The Forge of Chains~
   Chains are made here, and have been for a very long time:  the
walls are hung with them from vault to floor, links thick as an arm,
each one stamped with the Spire's mark.  A channel of white iron runs
down the middle of the floor, and the moulds stand open beside it.~
