#3212
The Warden's Watch~
   The watch is a gallery above the Ash Court with a window of thick
green glass on each face.  Logs, rosters and Tallies of Ash are
pinned to the walls in careful columns.  The Spire's garrison keeps
its records here, and keeps them well.~
