#3215
The Chain Bridge~
   The bridge is a span of chain links laid flat and lashed with wire,
and it crosses the tower's interior from wall to wall over a drop
that has no visible bottom.  The heat of the foundry comes up out of
it, and the chains ring faintly underfoot.~
