#3216
The Hall of the Grey Council~
   Twelve chairs of grey stone stand in a half circle, and ash has
settled on eleven of them.  The hall's floor has been scrubbed, and
the Spire's law is cut into the walls in letters of inlaid tin.  The
twelfth chair is pulled out from the circle, as if someone has just
left it.~
