#3217
The Spellforge Void~
   There is no floor here, in the ordinary sense:  the room is a void
lit from below by a red glow, and a stair of black glass crosses it
in a long curve.  Spells that are finished go down into the glow, and
the glow burns them, and the light never dims.~
