#3222
The Furnace Vault~
   The vault is the Spire's heart:  a chamber of black basalt with a
furnace in the middle of it that has no door and no flue.  The heat
here is a weight on the shoulders.  Chains from the forge below come
up through the floor and go down into the furnace, and are drawn out
again, glowing.~
