#3227
The Crown of the Spire~
   The crown is a platform of black basalt at the very top of the
tower, and the ash falls upward here.  A throne of the same basalt
stands at its centre, and the Spire's banner hangs from a pole
behind it, heavy with grey frost.  The whole world lies below:
the Marches, the drowned valley, and the small green fields of the
living, far to the south.~
